Vendored files: score.py and pose_matching.py from bop_toolkit_lib/, plus misc.py, which
holds only the `log` function of bop_toolkit_lib/misc.py (the one helper score.py calls).
The package __init__.py is local. doper.bop.ap uses score.calc_ap,
score.calc_pose_detection_scores and pose_matching.match_poses_scene to compute the BOP24
detection AP exactly as scripts/eval_calc_scores.py does; the pose errors come from
doper.evaluation.bop_metrics (toolkit_mssd, toolkit_mspd, toolkit_symmetry_transforms).

